,"text":"My back hurts","file":"en_0033.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"என் முதுகு வலிக்கிறது","file":"ta_0034.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I have pain in my neck","file":"en_0035.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"என் கழுத்தில் வலி இருக்கிறது","file":"ta_0036.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I can feel sensation in my legs","file":"en_0037.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"என் கால்களில் உணர்வு தெரிகிறது","file":"ta_0038.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I can feel sensation in my left leg","file":"en_0039.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"என் இடது காலில் உணர்வு தெரிகிறது","file":"ta_0040.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I can feel sensation in my right leg","file":"en_0041.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"என் வலது காலில் உணர்வு தெரிகிறது","file":"ta_0042.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I can feel sensation in my feet","file":"en_0043.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"என் பாதங்களில் உணர்வு தெரிகிறது","file":"ta_0044.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I can feel tingling in my legs","file":"en_0045.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"என் கால்களில் சிலிர்ப்பு தெரிகிறது","file":"ta_0046.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I love you","file":"en_0047.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"நான் உன்னை நேசிக்கிறேன்","file":"ta_0048.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"Thank you","file":"en_0049.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"நன்றி","file":"ta_0050.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I am feeling better today","file":"en_0051.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"இன்று நான் நலமாக உணர்கிறேன்","file":"ta_0052.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I am happy","file":"en_0053.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"நான் மகிழ்ச்சியாக இருக்கிறேன்","file":"ta_0054.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I am bored","file":"en_0055.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"எனக்கு சலிப்பாக இருக்கிறது","file":"ta_0056.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I will be okay. Do not worry","file":"en_0057.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"நான் சரியாவேன். கவலைப்படாதீர்கள்","file":"ta_0058.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I am proud of myself","file":"en_0059.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"நான் வலிமையாக இருக்கிறேன்","file":"ta_0060.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"God will help me","file":"en_0061.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"இறைவன் உதவுவான்","file":"ta_0062.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"Where is Hari?","file":"en_0063.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"ஹரி எங்கே?","file":"ta_0064.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"Where is Vimala?","file":"en_0065.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"விமலா எங்கே?","file":"ta_0066.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"Please hold my hand","file":"en_0067.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"என் கையை பிடியுங்கள்","file":"ta_0068.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I want to see my family","file":"en_0069.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"என் குடும்பத்தினரை பார்க்க வேண்டும்","file":"ta_0070.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"Tell me good news","file":"en_0071.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"நல்ல செய்தி சொல்லுங்கள்","file":"ta_0072.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I want to listen to music","file":"en_0073.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"இசை கேட்க வேண்டும்","file":"ta_0074.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"How is work going?","file":"en_0075.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"வேலை எப்படி போகிறது?","file":"ta_0076.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"Tell me more about cricket","file":"en_0077.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"கிரிக்கெட் பத்தி சொல்லுங்கள்","file":"ta_0078.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"How is everyone at home?","file":"en_0079.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"வீட்டில் எல்லாரும் எப்படி இருக்கிறார்கள்?","file":"ta_0080.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I am getting better every day","file":"en_0081.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"நான் ஒவ்வொரு நாளும் நலமடைகிறேன்","file":"ta_0082.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I love you all so much","file":"en_0083.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"நான் உங்கள் அனைவரையும் மிகவும் நேசிக்கிறேன்","file":"ta_0084.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"I have written something. Please look at my screen.","file":"en_0085.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"நான் ஏதோ எழுதியிருக்கிறேன். என் திரையை பாருங்கள்.","file":"ta_0086.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"My pain level is 1 out of 10","file":"en_0087.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"என் வலி அளவு 10-ல் 1","file":"ta_0088.mp3"},{"lang":"en","text":"My pain level is 2 out of 10","file":"en_0089.mp3"},{"lang":"ta","text":"என் வலி அளவு 10-ல் 2